      "content": {
        "text": "Capstone: unusual wording often mixes scaling and unit conversion.\n\nThe method stays stable: convert units, name the invariant, decide direct/inverse, then calculate.\n\nIf you can explain why the direction is right, you are no longer memorising Chain Rule — you understand it.",
